## Sigil Registry

Grammar self-hosted. 97 SharktoothSigil tiddlers carry the full vocabulary.
`grammar-cache.ts` reads `[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/tags/SharktoothSigil]]`.
Adding a sigil means tagging a tiddler — no code change required.

THE SHADOW STORE IS NOT OPTIONAL. These tiddlers ride inside the plugin, so every one of them is a
SHADOW; a filter naming the tiddler store alone matched zero, and the loader returned null from its
own empty-set guard while the hardcoded bootstrap scans carried the whole render. Self-hosting became
REAL on 2026-09-08, not on the day it was written.

