## Law of Fives — Invariant Ladders

Two orthogonal 5-point axes: `LADDER_5` (action→week, finest→coarsest) and `OODA_HA_5` (act→aftermath, active→reflective).
Phase runs counter to scale — act maps to action (finest); aftermath maps to week (coarsest).
Exported from `packages/lararium-mesh/src/ast.ts` as `LADDER_5`, `OODA_HA_5`, `SCOPE_5`.

