## Stances, Syad, and Tools

Three separate graphs. Stances encode epistemic register (Syad predicate). Tools encode aperture and feed direction. Syad encodes 7 truth-value compounds. The graphs connect but do not collapse.

Register measures confidence *within* the active stance — not universal truth weight.

